  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Georgian Young Lawyers&#x2019; Association in Georgia 2024-25 - Project support GYLA 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xF6;d till Georgian Young Lawyers&#x2019; Association i Georgien 2024-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom st&#xF6;det ska Georgian Young Lawyers&#x2019; Association (GYLA) st&#xE4;rka respekten f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter i Georgien genom att dokumentera kr&#xE4;nkningar av m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter, &#xF6;ka kunskap och medvetenhet om grundl&#xE4;ggande m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter bland s&#xE5;v&#xE4;l georgiska som internationella akt&#xF6;rer, st&#xF6;dja georgiska civilsamh&#xE4;llesorganisationer som verkar f&#xF6;r st&#xE4;rkta m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter, samt st&#xF6;dja individer som f&#xE5;tt sina m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter kr&#xE4;nkta.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the support, the Georgian Young Lawyers&apos; Association (GYLA) shall strengthen respect for human rights in Georgia by documenting violations of human rights, increase knowledge and awareness of basic human rights among both Georgian and international actors, support Georgian civil society organizations that work for strengthened human rights , as well as support individuals who have had their human rights violated.</narrative>
  </description>
